   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen kommer att tillhandah&#xe5;lla den jordanska l&#xe4;kemedelsindustrin med grundl&#xe4;ggande kunskap om utarbetande av registreringsans&#xf6;kan enligt v&#xe4;sterl&#xe4;ndska krav, grundl&#xe4;ggande kunskap om internationella patentregler samt strategier och kunskap hur f&#xf6;retagen uppfyller internationella standards f&#xf6;r Good Manufacturing Practice.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will provide the Jordanian pharmaceutical industry with basic know-how for preparing regulatory files meeting Western demands,basic know-how on international patent rules and strategies as well asknowledge to which extent the manufacturers comply with international standards for Good Manufacturing Practice.</narrative>
